gateway copy-turn.json
wait 2
type /copy
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 1
snap copy-empty
clip copy-empty
type /copy now
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 1
snap copy-now
clip copy-now
type first question alpha
key Enter
wait 3
snap turn1
type /copy
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 1
snap copy
clip copy
clipfail on
type /copy
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 1
snap copy-fail
clip copy-fail
clipfail off
